{
  "id": "explore-what-to-fix-on-a-dashboard-lj-preview",
  "title": "Where dashboards fall short (preview)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore dashboards on Grafana Play to see where a panel's title or unit leaves a viewer unsure what it shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore panels on Grafana Play to see where a repeated title or a missing unit leaves a viewer unsure what a panel shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "sample-website",
      "title": "Sample Website Dashboard",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000003/sample-website-dashboard?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open the **Sample Website Dashboard**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-31']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the first **Google hits** panel, a gauge."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-24']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the second **Google hits** panel, a bar gauge."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Two panels share the title **Google hits**, so the title doesn't say which panel shows what."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-5']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the **client side full page load** panel."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This panel has no unit set, so its values appear as plain numbers. A viewer can't tell whether they are seconds, milliseconds, or something else."
        }
      ]
    },
